  "content": "<center><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">现实中的树木是<strong>圆的</strong>——为什么在 Minecraft 里不是呢？于是我做了一个材质包，立志解决这个问题！</span><br /><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">现在你可以安息了，因为你的树木终于变圆了，如它们本该有的样子。</span><br /><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">与其它资源包完全兼容，只需确保将「圆形树木」放在加载顺序的最上方！</span></p>\n<img alt=\"一棵巨大的圆形橡树俯瞰着满是其他圆形树木的森林\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/XlqZTP4W/images/ae36e495ff5454c55249e1bbdec7930c417dcb84.webp\"/>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/f4eb3536092ffc67ba61236a96a7115a44f65098.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"842\" height=\"219\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">想要茂密的树叶？来看看配套的材质包：<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/better-leaves\">Motschen 的 Better Leaves。</a></span></p>\n<a title=\"圆形树木项目页面\" href=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/better-leaves\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/ff62e782ee2fbe5fec71a7c14ac5f38a4f350f07.png\" alt=\"Better Leaves 标志\" width=\"496\" height=\"129\" /></a>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<details>\n<summary>明确支持的模组（v8.0）：</summary>\n\n<ul>\n  <li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/ad-astra\">Ad Astra</a></li>\n  <li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/architects-palette\">Architect's Palette</a></li>\n  <li><a href=\"\">Atmospheric</a></li>\n  <li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/aurorasdecorations\">Aurora's Decorations</a></li>\n  <li><a href=\"\">Autumnity</a></li>\n  <li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/betterend\">Better End</a></li>\n  <li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/betternether\">Better Nether</a></li>\n  <li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/bewitchment\">Bewitchment</a></li>\n  <li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/biome-makeover\">Biome Makeover</a></li>\n  <li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/biomes-o-plenty\">Biomes O' Plenty</a></li>\n  <li><a href=\"\">Blockus</a></li>\n  <li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/blossom\">Blossom</a></li>\n  <li><a href=\"\">Botania</a></li>\n  <li><a href=\"\">Chipped</a></li>\n  <li><a href=\"\">Cluttered</a></li>\n  <li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/cobblemon\">Cobblemon</a></li>\n  <li><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/mod/croptopia\">Croptopia</a></li>\n  <li><a href=\"\">Cultural Delights</a></li>\n  <li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/deeperdarker\">Deeper and Darker</a></li>\n  <li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/ecologics\">Ecologics</a></li>\n  <li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/ends-phantasm\">End's Phantasm</a></li>\n  <li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/environmental\">Environmental</a></li>\n  <li><a href=\"\">Fortuituous Feasts</a></li>\n  <li><a href=\"\">Hellion's Sniffer+</a></li>\n  <li><a href=\"\">Hibernal Herbs</a></li>\n  <li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/lets-do-beachparty\">[Let's Do] Beachparty</a></li>\n  <li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/lets-do-blooming-nature\">[Let's Do] Blooming Nature</a></li>\n  <li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/lets-do-meadow\">[Let's Do] Meadow</a></li>\n  <li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/lets-do-vinery\">[Let's Do] Vinery</a></li>\n  <li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/natures-spirit\">Nature's Spirit</a></li>\n  <li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/nethers-exoticism\">Nether's Exoticism</a></li>\n  <li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/mariposa\">Mariposa</a></li>\n  <li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/oh-the-biomes-weve-gone\">Oh The Biomes We've Gone</a></li>\n  <li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/paradise-lost\">Paradise Lost</a></li>\n  <li><a href=\"\">Promenade</a></li>\n  <li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/quark\">Quark</a></li>\n  <li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/regions-unexplored\">Regions Unexplored</a></li>\n  <li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/tech-reborn\">Tech Reborn</a></li>\n  <li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/terrestria\">Terrestria</a></li>\n  <li><a href=\"\">Terraqueous</a></li>\n  <li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/the-undergarden\">The Undergarden</a></li>\n  <li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/traverse\">Traverse</a></li>\n  <li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/the-aether\">The Aether</a></li>\n  <li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/wilder-wild\">Wilder Wild</a></li>\n</ul>\n</details>",
